3. Reproduce with a standalone script in /tmp (NOT in the repo):
   - `@click.option('--flag', is_flag=True)` with `default_map={'flag': True}` and with `{'flag': False}`;
   - `@click.option('--flag', is_flag=True, default=False)` / `default=True` with default_map True/False;
   - `@click.option('--flag/--no-flag', default=False)` with default_map True/False;
   - a flag with `flag_value='x'` and default_map values;
   - a non-flag option with default_map (control, must keep working);
   - also passing the flag on the command line while default_map is set (command line must win);
   - and a `Group` with default_map on a subcommand.
   Run with `cd /click && python /tmp/repro_dm.py`. Report which variants diverge from the documented/expected behavior.
