5. Implement the MINIMAL fix in /click/src/click/core.py so that a default_map value is honored for flags (and command line still wins, and non-flag behavior is unchanged).
6. Verify: (a) your repro script shows correct behavior for all variants; (b) `cd /click && python -m pytest tests -q` -> must report exactly `488 passed, 21 skipped, 1 xfailed` (baseline; no failures allowed); (c) `cd /click && python -m pytest tests/test_defaults.py tests/test_options.py tests/test_basic.py -q`.

